      "adr": "docs/decisions/0013-link-v1-implementation-mapping.md",
      "reason": "One assertion assumed the public stylesheet contained only Button's tokens ('Button should consume the whole 37-token closure'). ADR 0012 allows later components to add tokens, so the assertion now compares button.css with Button's approved contract (tests/button-v1-spec.json) instead of the whole stylesheet. Button's source, CSS, stories, docs and every other check are unchanged; the linter, its self-tests and the 37-token requirement are unchanged."
    }
